### ============================================
### Core Service - HTTP Smoke Tests
### 使用方式: 在 IntelliJ/WebStorm 中逐请求运行
### ============================================

### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health

### ---------- 注册 ----------
### 正常注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "smoke_test_{{$timestamp}}",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "nickname": "smoke"
}

### 重复注册（应返回 409）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### ---------- 登录 ----------
### 正确登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 错误密码（应返回 401）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### ---------- 用户信息 ----------
### 获取当前用户（需要 token）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv TOKEN}}

### 获取指定用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/1

### ---------- 视频 ----------
### 推荐视频
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/video/random/visitor

### 分类列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/category

### ---------- Token 刷新 ----------
### 刷新 token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/token/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{$dotenv REFRESH_TOKEN}}"
}
